$ is perpendicular to the given line." 13194139534483 true] [17592186291390 1000 #edb/ref 17592186291391 13194139534483 true] [17592186291390 1000 #edb/ref 17592186291392 13194139534483 true] [17592186291390 1000 #edb/ref 17592186291393 13194139534483 true] [17592186291390 1000 #edb/ref 17592186291394 13194139534483 true] [17592186291390 1000 #edb/ref 17592186291395 13194139534483 true] [17592186291390 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534483 true] [17592186291390 1041 "selection" 13194139534483 true] [17592186291390 1104 #edb/ref 17592186291392 13194139534483 true] [17592186291390 1110 #uuid "eb2273bf-a71f-5940-95ea-711271f7116a" 13194139534483 true] [17592186291391 1034 "y=\\frac{x}{2}-\\frac{5}{2}" 13194139534483 true] [17592186291391 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534483 true] [17592186291391 1111 #uuid "8dc6da4f-977d-5a2e-8bf9-f1f8f971be13" 13194139534483 true] [17592186291392 1034 "y=\\frac{x}{4}-5" 13194139534483 true] [17592186291392 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534483 true] [17592186291392 1111 #uuid "2244df98-3e18-5a80-80fb-b36bc6f00242" 13194139534483 true] [17592186291393 1034 "y=-\\frac{2}{3}x+2" 13194139534483 true] [17592186291393 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534483 true] [17592186291393 1111 #uuid "eb42405b-9467-54a1-abcc-bf4ffc8f85ca" 13194139534483 true] [17592186291394 1034 "y=4x+3" 13194139534483 true] [17592186291394 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534483 true] [17592186291394 1111 #uuid "404073ca-72fb-5104-992d-5dba92e853c3" 13194139534483 true] [17592186291395 1034 "y=-4x+3" 13194139534483 true] [17592186291395 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534483 true] [17592186291395 1111 #uuid "87caf5f7-1192-5784-9e83-bb02335c1516" 13194139534483 true] [17592186291396 1017 #edb/ref 17592186291397 13194139534483 true] [17592186291396 1089 "q-73084" 13194139534483 true] [17592186291396 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139534483 true] [17592186291396 1100 "If $f(x)$ is right-continuous at $x=-1$ and $f(-1)=-2,$ then what is \n${lim}_{x\\to (-1)^{+}}\\,\\frac{1}{3f(x)-10x}?$" 13194139534483 true] [17592186291396 1113 #uuid "7e4d9326-2ae7-55cb-8a17-5cc3ba49aafc" 13194139534483 true] [17592186291396 1145 "Since $f(x)$ is right-continuous at $x=-1,$ we must have\n\n$$\n{lim}_{x\\to (-1)^{+}}f(x)=f(-1)=-2.\n$$\n\nConsequently,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to (-1)^{+}}\\,\\frac{1}{3f(x)-10x} & =\\frac{1}{3{lim}_{x\\to (-1)^{+}}f(x)-10{lim}_{x\\to (-1)^{+}}x} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3(-2)-10(-1)} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534483 true] [17592186291397 1000 #edb/ref 17592186291398 13194139534483 true] [17592186291397 1000 #edb/ref 17592186291399 13194139534483 true] [17592186291397 1000 #edb/ref 17592186291400 13194139534483 true] [17592186291397 1000 #edb/ref 17592186291401 13194139534483 true] [17592186291397 1000 #edb/ref 17592186291402 13194139534483 true] [17592186291397 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534483 true] [17592186291397 1041 "selection" 13194139534483 true] [17592186291397 1104 #edb/ref 17592186291400 13194139534483 true] [17592186291397 1110 #uuid "63c3a0ae-7715-5855-a1ff-9efcb9e5816c" 13194139534483 true] [17592186291398 1034 "\\frac{1}{2}" 13194139534483 true] [17592186291398 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534483 true] [17592186291398 1111 #uuid "6d38fdfd-fe89-587f-bde9-cafd1e17f69b" 13194139534483 true] [17592186291399 1034 "2" 13194139534483 true] [17592186291399 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534483 true] [17592186291399 1111 #uuid "b86b3061-41b3-5095-9d00-e339d320775d" 13194139534483 true] [17592186291400 1034 "\\frac{1}{4}" 13194139534483 true] [17592186291400 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534483 true] [17592186291400 1111 #uuid "ab0ef3c9-9503-5d85-bf7e-bbc0d320a329" 13194139534483 true] [17592186291401 1034 "-\\frac{1}{8}" 13194139534483 true] [17592186291401 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534483 true] [17592186291401 1111 #uuid "590f7a82-534e-5881-a2a4-b60a0c9c5df8" 13194139534483 true] [17592186291402 1034 "-\\fra